# The whole bank: P1 set on each note's own step (a step lock) to all 32 patches in turn (P1 = 8 n + 4); dx sees
# through the OS's P1 smoothing and plays the new patch from the note's first sample. Lead track; bass patches
# play two octaves down, bells and mallets an octave up.
tempo 150
steps 64
tail 2.0
track lead
preset 4 128 0 0 255 60 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C4 1 110
param p1 12 2
note 2 C4 1 110
param p1 20 4
note 4 C4 1 110
param p1 28 6
note 6 C4 1 110
param p1 36 8
note 8 C4 1 110
param p1 44 10
note 10 C2 1 110
param p1 52 12
note 12 C2 1 110
param p1 60 14
note 14 C2 1 110
param p1 68 16
note 16 C2 1 110
param p1 76 18
note 18 C2 1 110
param p1 84 20
note 20 C2 1 110
param p1 92 22
note 22 C4 1 110
param p1 100 24
note 24 C4 1 110
param p1 108 26
note 26 C4 1 110
param p1 116 28
note 28 C4 1 110
param p1 124 30
note 30 C4 1 110
param p1 132 32
note 32 C4 1 110
param p1 140 34
note 34 C4 1 110
param p1 148 36
note 36 C4 1 110
param p1 156 38
note 38 C4 1 110
param p1 164 40
note 40 C4 1 110
param p1 172 42
note 42 C4 1 110
param p1 180 44
note 44 C4 1 110
param p1 188 46
note 46 C5 1 110
param p1 196 48
note 48 C5 1 110
param p1 204 50
note 50 C5 1 110
param p1 212 52
note 52 C5 1 110
param p1 220 54
note 54 C5 1 110
param p1 228 56
note 56 C5 1 110
param p1 236 58
note 58 C5 1 110
param p1 244 60
note 60 C5 1 110
param p1 252 62
note 62 C5 1 110
expect sound 0 64
expect idle 72
expect peak_below -6      # one voice peaks at -12 dBFS
